# Copy to .env.local for local development. Vercel holds the real production
# values as project env vars.
#
# SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY — the waitlist API route
# (src/app/api/waitlist/route.ts) writes signups to the app's shared
# Supabase project (POC stage: one database for the app and this site). The
# anon key is a public client key — the same one shipped inside the Limere
# app binary — and the `waitlist` table's RLS policy only grants anon INSERT,
# no SELECT, so this key can record a signup but can't read any rows back.
# The route already falls back to the live project's values if these are
# unset, so they're optional locally; set them to point at a different
# project (e.g. a local `supabase start` instance) instead.
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
